      "source_xml_line": 518,
      "string_id": "mil_dolg_soldier_dialog_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Three assholes down, just like that! You came just in time: didn't blow our cover and came out safe and sound. By the way, I think no one has to know about this, eh?",
      "JA_current": "おやおや、クソッタレが3人あの世へ行ったようだ。お前、来るタイミングがよかったぜ。俺たちの存在をバラしちまうこともなく、音を立てずにじっとしてたな。さて、ここで何が起きたか、誰も知らない、そうだな？",
      "JA_new": "くそ野郎を3人も片付けた！ちょうどいい時に来たな。俺たちの正体はバレず、あんたも無事だ。ところで、この件は誰にも言わなくていいよな？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "mil_dolg_soldier_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_military.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
